{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21188","headline":"酬乐天 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放鹤在深水，置鱼在高枝。\n升沈或异势，同谓非所宜。\n君爲邑中吏，皎皎鸾凤姿。\n顾我何爲者，翻侍白玉墀。\n昔作芸香侣，三载不暂离。\n逮兹忽相失，旦夕梦魂思。\n崔嵬骊山顶，宫树遥参差。\n祗得两相望，不得长相随。\n多君岁寒意，裁作秋兴诗。\n上言风尘苦，下言时节移。\n官家事拘束，安得携手期。\n愿爲云与雨，会合天之垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}